# Build output. A compiled binary in the repository is not just clutter: what
# was committed here was a Linux ELF named "ishakat", with no extension, so a
# Windows user who cloned the project found a file the loader does not recognise
# as a program and PowerShell opened it in an editor. Binaries come from
# `make build`, per host.
bin/
